  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ndola Justice and Peace Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To promote the Social Teachings of the Church in order to enable individuals and communities to engage with relevant issues of social and economic justice 
2. To advocate for enhanced transparency and accountability in local government 
3 To enhance the capacity of Justice and Peace staff at Diocesan and Deanery level for improved implementation and management of programme work. 

Outcomes
Empowered communities that support, and advocate for pro-poor policies and practices
Empowered communities that are able to use their faith to act on issues affecting them,
Enhanced capacity of Justice and peace to support communities to address issues of justice and peace in the diocese,</narrative>
  </description>
